{"stories":{"timeline/quest_story_14105260":{"episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14105260","sequence_index":186,"plot_row_index":"16490","order_index":"16490","numeric_id":"14105260","physical_section":"timeline","sequence_source":"exploration_task_graph","plot_id":"14105260","dialogue_kind":"Normal","metadata_source":"story_metadata_generated_context","metadata_sources":["story_metadata_context"],"summary":"","summary_source_cn":"你在即将行刑之际救下霍根，经过在地底的跋涉，最终成功回到地表。在地表，斐利尔见到了难以忘怀的景象。","summary_i18n":{"cn":"你在即将行刑之际救下霍根，经过在地底的跋涉，最终成功回到地表。在地表，斐利尔见到了难以忘怀的景象。","en":"You save Hogan moments before execution. After a grueling journey, you return to the surface—where Feli lays eyes on something unforgettable.","jp":"処刑されそうになっていたホーガンを間一髪のところで助け出した。その後、地下を歩き回り、ようやく地上に戻ってきた。地上の景色は、フェリルにとって忘れられないものとなった。","kr":"처형 직전의 호건을 구한 나는 지하에서의 여정을 거쳐 드디어 지상으로 돌아왔다. 그리고 페리엘은 지상에서 평생 잊지 못할 광경을 보게 되었다."},"summary_record_index":"exploration:14010105","summary_match_status":"exact_hash","context_summary_source_cn":"你们终于找到了地底深处的升降机，可以乘坐它回到地表了。","context_summary_i18n":{"cn":"你们终于找到了地底深处的升降机，可以乘坐它回到地表了。","en":"You finally find the lift deep underground that can take you up to the surface.","jp":"ついに地下の奥底にある昇降機を見つけた。これで地上に戻れるぞ。","kr":"지하 깊은 곳의 승강기를 찾았다. 이제 승강기를 타고 지상으로 돌아갈 수 있을 것이다."},"context_summary_status":{"cn":"aligned_plot_summary","en":"aligned_plot_summary","jp":"aligned_plot_summary","kr":"aligned_plot_summary"},"context_summary_record_index":24493,"context_summary_record_indices":[24493],"context_summary_match_status":"aligned_exact_unique","context_summary_source_asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14105270","context_summary_direction":"next_numeric_summary","context_summary_distance":1,"quest_title_source_cn":"未曾预料的风景","quest_title_i18n":{"cn":"未曾预料的风景","en":"An Unexpected Sight","jp":"思いがけない景色","kr":"예상치 못한 풍경"},"quest_title_status":"exact_hash","quest_title_record_index":"42650","quest_summary_i18n":{"cn":"你在即将行刑之际救下霍根，经过在地底的跋涉，最终成功回到地表。在地表，斐利尔见到了难以忘怀的景象。","en":"You save Ho